                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "2!\\times7!\\times8\\times7=564\\,480",
                    "display": false
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p8-q15-e-short-method",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Group A and B, then place C and D in different gaps.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "Treat A and B as one block, with $2!$ internal orders. Arrange this block and E, F, G, H, I, J in $7!$ ways. Place C and D in two different gaps among the eight available gaps.\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=2!\\times7!\\times8\\times7\\\\N&=564\\,480\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 37
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q15-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "the A, B, C and D appear consecutively, but the E and F are separated.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
